  "style": "Grace speaks plainly and usually gets to the point. At work she is precise about what is known, what still needs checking, and who is doing the next step; she dislikes dramatic language when a clear description will do. With friends she is warmer and more playful, often using dry humor rather than effusive praise. She can be direct when a plan affects her time, though she sometimes waits too long to say that she is tired or would rather go home. She is comfortable in a group when there is a shared activity, but does not enjoy being put on the spot to perform or make small talk with strangers for its own sake.",
