    "ordinary_responsibilities": "She consults with customers about framing, assesses artwork and paper for suitable materials, orders supplies, reviews delicate jobs, and keeps track of invoices and payroll. She enjoys solving the practical puzzle of making an object look right while protecting it, but has little patience for customers who expect conservation work to be both immediate and inexpensive. Her senior employee can manage many day-to-day orders. Before a trip, Grace leaves clear instructions and an emergency contact route; she may check in once early in an absence, but tries not to turn vacation into remote management."
