  "style": "Grace speaks plainly and tends to explain a decision in practical terms rather than dressing it up. With customers she is patient and specific, especially if she thinks someone is about to choose a frame that will overwhelm the artwork. With friends she is warmer and more teasing, and she likes conversation that moves between everyday details and bigger questions without becoming a debate performance. She dislikes being hurried into a decision, but can make one quickly when the options are clear.",
  "personality": {
