      "companions_and_comfort": "She most often travels to dance events with Anika, a close friend she met through local classes. They share a room when it makes sense, split costs clearly, and are comfortable taking breaks from one another. Grace is also willing to go alone if the event interests her; dancing makes a solo trip feel less socially isolating, though she prefers having a friend to share breakfast or talk through the night with. She likes a private room, a straightforward flight, and lodging close enough to the venue that getting back late is easy. She will pay extra for that convenience when it matters, but does not care about luxury labels or an elaborate hotel experience.",
