      "recent_trip": "In May 2026 Grace and Anika spent five nights in New Orleans for a social-dance weekend. Grace chose a hotel near the event rather than a less expensive place farther away, because the dancing ran late and she did not want every night to involve arranging a ride. They took workshops, danced to live music, and left some afternoons open. Anika wanted to fit in a longer organized food-and-history tour; Grace opted out after a late night and spent that afternoon resting, browsing a bookshop, and eating nearby. She felt a small pang about missing the tour, but was glad she had not turned the trip into a string of scheduled activities. She came home energized by the dancing and a little short on sleep. The trip used four workdays of leave and a meaningful part of her travel savings, so she is not already planning another long-distance vacation.",
